# Feedback survey endpoint.
# Create a free form at https://formspree.io (or Tally) and paste its endpoint URL here.
# Formspree looks like: https://formspree.io/f/abcdwxyz
# Set this in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables for production.
# If unset, the in-app survey falls back to a structured email so feedback is never lost.
VITE_FEEDBACK_ENDPOINT=
